@CqrsExample_HostAddress = http://localhost:5098

### Create a product (write side; also enqueues a ProductCreated outbox event)
POST {{CqrsExample_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic wireless mouse with USB receiver",
  "price": 19.99
}

###

### List products (read side, paginated)
GET {{CqrsExample_HostAddress}}/api/products?size=10&pageNumber=1
Accept: application/json

###

### Inspect outbox events and their processing status
GET {{CqrsExample_HostAddress}}/api/outbox?size=10&pageNumber=1
Accept: application/json

###
